# Folded digits: U54 input S (V4) stuck at 1; the top half of each digit cell gets the bottom
# half's strokes (e for f, c for b, d for g, nothing for a).
machine tennis
title "Folded digits"
brief "The scores are drawn in strange shapes: no digit has its top bar, and they change as the score goes up."
